  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>第1步&nbsp;</strong>打造一个100x60cm的木制框架，并固定在地板上。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "插图：将储物柜固定在一起组成岛台基底的方法。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/0d/50/0d502a04d247afbe88403595ed41df68.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/0d/50/0d502a04d247afbe88403595ed41df68.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>第2步&nbsp;</strong>将6个 METOD 米多 储物柜（每个40x40cm）排成两排，每排各3个，然后按照箭头所示将它们紧紧固定在一起。再选6个储物柜，重复上述步骤。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "插图：将储物柜固定在一起组成岛台基底的方法。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
